# Harness & docs reading load

## Intent

Cleanup means **less unnecessary reading** for the next agent/session — not deleting operational tooling.

## Do

- Prefer `.agent/session-handoff.md` + `README_FULL.md` Decisions over re-reading old session notes.
- Keep **grit** + `./scripts/grit_reindex.sh` and short parallel-agent rules in `AGENTS.md` / handoff.
- Keep `feature_list.json` as inventory + evidence (all done is fine).

## Don't

- Delete grit/reindex, gates scripts, or mutmut wrappers as “theater.”
- Re-inflate `progress.md` with multi-page session diaries.
- Frame the repo as “pick the next unfinished feature” when the system is complete (unless the user opens new scope).
